# Professional Portfolio Implementation Plan

This plan outlines the creation of a modern, responsive portfolio for a Social Communication and Journalism student at UAO.

## Proposed Changes

### Project Setup
- [NEW] Initialize Next.js project with App Router, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.
- [NEW] Install `framer-motion` for animations and `react-icons` for iconography.
- [MODIFY] `tailwind.config.ts` to include UAO institutional colors (professional blue and bordeaux) and custom animations.

### Base Layout & UI Components
- [NEW] [Navbar.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/portafolio profesional/portafolio-profesional/components/layout/Navbar.tsx): Sticky navigation with active page indicators.
- [NEW] [Footer.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/portafolio profesional/portafolio-profesional/components/layout/Footer.tsx): Simple footer with social links.
- [NEW] [TransitionWrapper.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/portafolio profesional/portafolio-profesional/components/ui/TransitionWrapper.tsx): Handles page-to-page fade/slide transitions.
- [NEW] [AnimatedSection.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/portafolio profesional/portafolio-profesional/components/ui/AnimatedSection.tsx): Wrapper for scroll-triggered fade-in animations.

### Dashboard (Home Page)
- [NEW] [HeroSection.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/portafolio profesional/portafolio-profesional/components/dashboard/HeroSection.tsx): Main landing area with profile photo placeholder.
- [NEW] [GeneralInfo.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/portafolio profesional/portafolio-profesional/components/dashboard/GeneralInfo.tsx): Name, University, and Bio.
- [NEW] [StatsSection.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/portafolio profesional/portafolio-profesional/components/dashboard/StatsSection.tsx): Student achievements metrics.

### Experience Page
- [NEW] [ExperienceTimeline.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/portafolio profesional/portafolio-profesional/components/experiencia/ExperienceTimeline.tsx): Vertical or horizontal timeline of professional growth.
- [NEW] [ExperienceCard.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/portafolio profesional/portafolio-profesional/components/experiencia/ExperienceCard.tsx): Detailed cards for each role with tags.

### Contact Page
- [NEW] [ContactLinks.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/portafolio profesional/portafolio-profesional/components/contacto/ContactLinks.tsx): Grid of contact options (WhatsApp, Phone, LinkedIn).

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` to ensure project integrity.
- Use `npm run dev` to verify visual layout and animations.

### Manual Verification
- Check responsiveness on mobile, tablet, and desktop views.
- Verify that fade-in animations trigger correctly on scroll.
- Ensure page transitions are smooth.
